# docs/TOS/*.md files are rendered at runtime by TosDocumentService (see
# src/Domain/Services/TosDocumentService.php) for the Terms of Service page, so they must be
# included in the prod image even though **/*.md and docs/ are excluded above. Note: a directory
# excluded via a trailing-slash pattern (like "docs/") can't have its contents re-included without
# first re-including the directory itself, hence the extra "!docs/" + "docs/*" step below.
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/TOS/
!docs/TOS/**
